---
# yamllint configuration. It exists because the README tells a reader to run "yamllint .", and
# without this file that command uses yamllint's stock defaults and fails on a clean tree over the
# single rule waived below. A documented command that does not work is worse than an undocumented
# one: it is the first thing a contributor tries.
#
# Deliberately minimal. Every rule of the "default" profile stays on except the one that genuinely
# clashes with how this repository is written, and it was found by running the linter rather than by
# copying the sibling repository's waivers wholesale -- three of the four it carries are not needed
# here.

extends: default

rules:
  # The comments in this repository carry the reasoning behind each value, and reasoning does not fit
  # in eighty columns. They are wrapped at a hundred, which is the width the rest of the files use.
  # Every other rule of the profile stays on, "document-start" included: the one file that was
  # missing its "---" got it rather than the rule being turned off for the whole tree.
  line-length: disable

  # A GitHub Actions workflow needs a key literally named "on", which YAML 1.1 reads as a boolean.
  # This waiver arrives with the workflows themselves (#32) rather than ahead of them. Only KEYS are
  # exempted: a "yes"/"no"/"off" VALUE is still refused, which is the case that actually bites.
  truthy:
    check-keys: false

  # ! The five settings below are NOT preferences: ansible-lint REFUSES to offer its "--fix" mode
  #   unless it finds its own yamllint profile ("Found incompatible custom yamllint configuration",
  #   then "Fix mode will not be available"). It says so in a warning and keeps linting, so the
  #   capability disappears without anything failing -- which is how it went unnoticed until the
  #   profile was raised to "production". Changing any of them is choosing to lose "ansible-lint
  #   --fix"; that is a decision to write down here, not a side effect to discover.
  comments:
    min-spaces-from-content: 1
  comments-indentation: false
  braces:
    max-spaces-inside: 1
  octal-values:
    forbid-implicit-octal: true
    forbid-explicit-octal: true
